<!--
  The themed-icon layer, for the launchers that recolour every icon to the wallpaper.

  The same two paths as the foreground with the colour taken out: the system tints this
  whole drawable one colour, so a fill and a stroke that differ would come back identical
  and the outline would simply vanish. What is left is the silhouette, which is what a
  monochrome layer is meant to be.
-->
